  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 10 + 54 ÷ 9 - 4 × 60 = 116.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and × \n\nGiven: 10 + 54 ÷ 9 - 4 × 60 = 116\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get;\n\n⇒ 10 + __**54 ÷ 9**__ × 4 - 60 = 116\n\n⇒ 10 + __**6 × 4**__ - 60 = 116\n\n⇒ __**10 + 24**__ - 60 = 116\n\n⇒ __34** - 60**__ = 116\n\n⇒ -26 ≠ 116\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ÷ and × \n\nGiven: 10 + 54 ÷ 9 - 4 × 60 = 116\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 10 + 54 × 9 - __**4 ÷ 60**__ = 116\n\n⇒ 10 + __**54 × 9**__ - 0.06 = 116\n\n⇒ __**10 + 486**__ - 0.06 = 116\n\n⇒ __496 - 0.06__ = 116\n\n⇒ 405.94 ≠ 116\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) +** and × **\n\nGiven: 10 + 54 ÷ 9 - 4 × 60 = 116\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 10 × __**54 ÷ 9**__ - 4 + 60 = 116\n\n⇒ __**10 × 6**__ - 4 + 60 = 116\n\n⇒ __**60**__ - 4 __**+ 60**__ = 116\n\n⇒ __120 - 4__ = 116\n\n⇒ 116 = 116\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\nGiven: 10 + 54 ÷ 9 - 4 × 60 = 116\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 10 - __**54 ÷ 9**__ + 4 × 60 = 116\n\n⇒ 10 - 6 + __**4 × 60**__ = 116\n\n⇒ __**10**__ - 6 __**+ 240**__ = 116\n\n⇒ __250____ - 6__ = 116\n\n⇒ 244 ≠ 116\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
